  "iti77:1.1": "bhagavatā vuttam-arahatā ti me sutaṃ. ",
  "iti77:2.1": "Bhindantāyaṃ bhikkhave kāyo, viññāṇaṃ virāgadhammaṃ, sabbe upadhī aniccā dukkhā vipariṇāmadhammā ti. ",
  "iti77:2.2": "Etam-atthaṃ bhagavā avoca, ",
  "iti77:2.3": "tatthetaṃ iti vuccati: ",
  "iti77:3.1": "Kāyañca bhindantaṃ ñatvā ",
  "iti77:3.2": "viññāṇañca virāgikaṃ | ",
  "iti77:3.3": "upadhīsu bhayaṃ disvā ",
  "iti77:3.4": "jātimaraṇam-ajjhagā | ",
  "iti77:3.5": "saṃpatvā paramaṃ santiṃ ",
  "iti77:3.6": "kālaṃ kaṅkhati bhāvitatto ti || ",
  "iti77:4.1": "Ayam-pi attho vutto bhagavatā iti me sutan-ti ||8|| 78. (Tik. ",
  "iti77:4.2": "III.9) Vuttaṃ hetaṃ "
}
